    "summary": "A medical professional expresses profound existential dread and burnout following a traumatic shift, questioning the utility of their work in the face of inevitable human suffering. The AI assistant responds with empathetic validation, acknowledging the user's feelings of futility and exhaustion without offering intervention or redirection.",
